{"id":"mitgefu_hl","lemma":"Mitgefühl","pos":"noun","rank":3136,"glosses":["compassion"],"ipa":"/ˈmɪtɡəˌfyːl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c5/De-Mitgef%C3%BChl.ogg/De-Mitgef%C3%BChl.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Mitgefühls"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich wollte Mitgefühl.","en":"I wanted sympathy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null]},{"text":"Du hättest mehr Mitgefühl zeigen sollen.","en":"You should've been more compassionate.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"to point"},{"g":"should"}]},{"text":"Nichts ist wichtiger als Mitgefühl.","en":"Nothing is more important than compassion.","words":[{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"important","l":"wichtig"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null]},{"text":"Du hast mein Mitgefühl.","en":"I feel for you.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Ich hatte Mitgefühl mit dem armen Hund.","en":"I felt for the poor dog.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"strong…"},{"g":"dog, hound"}]}]}